<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>
        <%= title %>
    </title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.10.5/font/bootstrap-icons.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Merriweather&family=Poppins:wght@500&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.7/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"
        integrity="sha384-LN+7fdVzj6u52u30Kp6M/trliBMCMKTyK833zpbD+pXdCLuTusPj697FH4R/5mcr" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/layout.css">
</head>

<body class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100">

    <%- include("partials/navbar.ejs") %>

        <section class="flex-grow-1 faq-container">
            <div class="faq-header">

                <h2>💬 Your Questions, Answered</h2>
                <p>Explore some common queries we get from our readers</p>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-card">
                <div class="faq-question">What kind of content does MKZone offer?</div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    MKZone covers topics ranging from tech tutorials, coding tips, productivity hacks, to personal
                    insights
                    and trending digital topics.
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-card">
                <div class="faq-question">How frequently is MKZone updated?</div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    New articles are published every 5–7 days, with occasional surprise posts when there's exciting news
                    or
                    trending topics.
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-card">
                <div class="faq-question">Can I post my own articles on this blog?</div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    Yes! You can share your articles using our
                    <a href="/publish" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 no-line">Publish
                        Page</a>.
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-card">
                <div class="faq-question">Can I reuse your content on my site or social media?</div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    You’re welcome to share snippets with proper credit and a link back to the original post. Full
                    reproduction without permission is not allowed.
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-card">
                <div class="faq-question">How can I stay updated on new posts?</div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    Follow us on Instagram, Twitter, or LinkedIn to get instant
                    updates.
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-card">
                <div class="faq-question">How can I contact you directly?</div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    Use the Contact form on the site or email us at [ <a href="mailto:muktarbello32@gmail.com"
                        style="text-decoration: none;">muktarbello32@gmail.com</a>
                    ]. We try to respond within 24–48
                    hours.
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <%- include("partials/footer.ejs") %>

            <script src="/js/ui.js"></script>
            <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>

</body>

</html>
